{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Experience a sweet-sweet daily life with beautiful girls inspired by desserts!<br><strong>Sweet Girls Collection</strong> is a visual novel with no in-game choices\u2014simply enjoy reading the story. Choose a Sweet to pursue to start, then fully enjoy each of their individual storylines. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731130/extras/16005001_0.png?t=1748511025\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731130/extras/16006701_0.png?t=1748511025\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731130/extras/26105601_0.png?t=1748511025\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731130/extras/26107201_0.png?t=1748511025\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heroines Blessed by the power of Sweets:</strong><br>Meet charming girls called &quot;Sweets,&quot; each possessing their own personalities, backgrounds, and the mission of saving the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multi-Ending System:</strong><br>While the story follows a linear path, the ending changes depending on which heroine you select at the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Voice Acting &amp; High-Quality Visuals:</strong><br>All heroines are fully voiced. Enjoy the story with beautiful character illustrations and expressive visual storytelling.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731130?t=1748511025","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731130/1f189168f9a16e12c66169a800fe03aa9145eb23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748511025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap